{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  TEXT COLUMNS WITH IMAGES SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Flexible content section displaying text and images in column layout
  - Supports 1-3 columns with customizable image and text content
  - Dynamic product type detection for collection-specific content
  - Metafield integration for dynamic image and caption display
  - Responsive layout with configurable image widths and shapes
  - Wave styling options and background color customization
  - Product type normalization for proper collection linking
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DYNAMIC BACKGROUND COLOR STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Customizable background color from section settings
  - color_bg: Background color setting from theme editor
  - section-id-{{ section.id }}: Unique identifier for section-specific styling
  - Only applies when color_bg setting is not blank
  - Allows merchants to customize section appearance
{% endcomment %}
{% style %}
  {% unless section.settings.color_bg == blank %}
     .section-id-{{ section.id }} {
        background-color: {{ section.settings.color_bg }};
     }
  {% endunless %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DYNAMIC TYPOGRAPHY STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Customizable font weight and size from section settings
  - font_weight: Font weight setting (normal, bold, etc.)
  - font_size: Font size in pixels from theme editor
  - Applies to entire section for consistent typography
{% endcomment %}
  .section-id-{{ section.id }} {
     font-weight: {{ section.settings.font_weight }};
     font-size: {{ section.settings.font_size }}px;
  }

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  ANIMATION CONTAINER OVERFLOW FIX
  =============================================================================
  Ensures proper animation display when animations are enabled
  - cc-animate-enabled: Class applied when animations are active
  - shopify-section: Shopify's section wrapper class
  - position: relative for proper stacking context
  - overflow: visible to show animations that extend beyond container
{% endcomment %}
  .cc-animate-enabled .shopify-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: visible;
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  WAVE STYLING INTEGRATION
  =============================================================================
  Optional decorative wave borders for visual interest
  - wave: Wave position setting (none/top/bottom/both)
  - wave-styles: Snippet for rendering wave SVG elements
  - wave_position: Passes wave position to wave-styles snippet
  - section_id: Unique section identifier for styling
  - fill_color: Wave color matches section background color
{% endcomment %}
{%- if section.settings.wave != "none" -%}
  {%- render 'wave-styles', 
    wave_position: section.settings.wave, 
    section_id: section.id,
    fill_color: section.settings.color_bg -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  PRODUCT TYPE NORMALIZATION
  =============================================================================
  Converts product types to collection handles for proper linking
  - product_type: Product type converted to handle format
  - handleize filter: Converts text to URL-friendly format
  - Special handling for specific product types:
    - House Hoodie → House Hoodies (plural for collection)
    - JamTee → JamTees (plural for collection)
  - Double Cozy Cloak and Cozy Cloak get special handling
{% endcomment %}
{% assign product_type = product.type | handleize %}
{% if product.type == 'House Hoodie' %}
  {% assign product_type = 'House Hoodies' | handleize %}
{% endif %}
{% if product.type == 'JamTee' %}
  {% assign product_type = 'JamTees' | handleize %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SPECIAL PRODUCT TYPE HANDLING
  =============================================================================
  Empty conditional for special product types that need custom logic
  - Double Cozy Cloak and Cozy Cloak products
  - Placeholder for future special handling requirements
{% endcomment %}
{% if product.type == 'Double Cozy Cloak' or product.type == 'Cozy Cloak' %}
  
{% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  COLLECTION ASSIGNMENT
  =============================================================================
  Assigns collection based on normalized product type
  - collection: Collection object for current product type
  - collections[product_type]: Looks up collection by handle
  - Used for metafield content and related product information
{% endcomment %}
{% assign collection = collections[product_type] %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN SECTION CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Primary container with section identification and styling
  - id="section-id-{{ section.id }}": Unique section identifier
  - text-columns-with-images: Base section class
  - section-id-{{ section.id }}: CSS class for section-specific styling
  - half-gutter: Reduced spacing for tighter layout
  - section-spacing: Consistent vertical spacing between sections
  - use-alt-bg: Optional alternate background color class
  - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
{% endcomment %}
<div id="section-id-{{ section.id }}" class="text-columns-with-images section-id-{{ section.id }} half-gutter section-spacing {% if section.settings.alternate_bg_color %}use-alt-bg{% endif %}" data-cc-animate>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DYNAMIC IMAGE WIDTH STYLING
  =============================================================================
  CSS styles for customizable image widths per block
  - Loops through all blocks to set individual image widths
  - block.settings.image_width: Width setting from theme editor
  - #block-id-{{ block.id }}: Unique identifier for each block
  - .text-column__image: Image container class
  - max-width: Constrains image width to specified value
{% endcomment %}
  {% style %}
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
    #section-id-{{ section.id }} #block-id-{{ block.id }} .text-column__image {
      max-width: {{ block.settings.image_width }}px;
    }
    {%- endfor -%}
  {% endstyle %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SECTION HEADING & TITLE
  =============================================================================
  Section title with configurable alignment and container width
  - section-heading: Container for title and spacing
  - section-heading--with-spacing: Additional spacing class
  - align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}: Dynamic text alignment
  - wide-container: Full-width container option
  - container container--large: Standard large container option
  - data-cc-animate: Animation trigger for title entrance
{% endcomment %}
  {% if section.settings.title != blank %}
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--with-spacing
      align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}
      {% if section.settings.full_width %}
          wide-container
      {% else %}
        container container--large
      {% endif %}"
         data-cc-animate>
      <h2 class="h2">{{ section.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CONTENT CONTAINER WRAPPER
  =============================================================================
  Dynamic container wrapper based on full-width setting
  - wide-container: Full-width layout option
  - container container--large: Standard large container option
  - Controls overall content width and spacing
{% endcomment %}
  {% if section.settings.full_width %}
    <div class="wide-container">
  {% else %}
    <div class="container container--large">
  {% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  FLEXIBLE COLUMN LAYOUT
  =============================================================================
  Dynamic column layout based on number of blocks
  - flexible-layout: Base layout container class
  - flexible-layout--variable-columns: Variable column support
  - flexible-layout--columns-{{ section.blocks.size }}: Dynamic column count
  - align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}: Dynamic text alignment
  - Responsive grid that adapts to block count
{% endcomment %}
    <div class="flexible-layout flexible-layout--variable-columns flexible-layout--columns-{{ section.blocks.size }} align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}">
      {% for block in section.blocks %}
{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  INDIVIDUAL COLUMN BLOCK
  =============================================================================
  Individual column container with animation and styling
  - id="block-id-{{ block.id }}": Unique block identifier
  - column text-column: Base column styling classes
  - align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}: Dynamic text alignment
  - block.shopify_attributes: Shopify block attributes for theme editor
  - data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-up": Animation trigger for entrance
  - data-cc-animate-delay: Staggered animation delay based on block index
{% endcomment %}
        <div id="block-id-{{ block.id }}" class="column text-column align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
             data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-up" data-cc-animate-delay="{{ forloop.index | times: 0.15 }}s">
          
{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  METAFIELD IMAGE & TEXT ASSIGNMENT
  =============================================================================
  Dynamic content assignment based on block position
  - metafield_image: Image from collection metafields
  - metafield_text: Caption text from collection metafields
  - forloop.index: Current block position (1, 2, or 3)
  - collection.metafields.product: Product metafields namespace
  - column_1_image, column_2_image, column_3_image: Image metafields
  - column_1_caption, column_2_caption, column_3_caption: Caption metafields
  - Provides dynamic content based on product type and block position
{% endcomment %}
          {% assign metafield_image = blank %}
          {% if forloop.index == 1 %}
            {% assign metafield_image = collection.metafields.product.column_1_image | image_url %}
            {% assign metafield_text = collection.metafields.product.column_1_caption %}
          {% elsif forloop.index == 2 %}
            {% assign metafield_image = collection.metafields.product.column_2_image | image_url %}
            {% assign metafield_text = collection.metafields.product.column_2_caption %}
          {% elsif forloop.index == 3 %}
            {% assign metafield_image = collection.metafields.product.column_3_image | image_url %}
            {% assign metafield_text = collection.metafields.product.column_3_caption %}
          {% endif %}
          
{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  IMAGE DISPLAY LOGIC
  =============================================================================
  Conditional image rendering based on block settings and metafields
  - block.settings.enable_image: Boolean to show/hide image
  - text-column__image: Image container class
  - text-column__image--shape-{{ section.settings.media_shape }}: Dynamic image shape
  - Conditional link wrapping for clickable images
  - aria-label: Accessibility label for linked images
{% endcomment %}
          {% if block.settings.enable_image %}
            <div class="text-column__image text-column__image--shape-{{ section.settings.media_shape }}">
              {%- if block.settings.link != blank -%}<a href="{{ block.settings.link }}" {% if block.settings.title %}aria-label="{{ block.settings.title | escape }}"{% endif %}>{%- endif -%}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  IMAGE SOURCE PRIORITY LOGIC
  =============================================================================
  Hierarchical image source selection with fallbacks
  - Priority 1: Metafield images (collection-specific content)
  - Priority 2: Block settings images (theme editor content)
  - Priority 3: Video content (if no images available)
  - Fallback: Empty state with minimal height
  - responsive-image: Snippet for optimized image rendering
  - inline-video: Snippet for video content display
{% endcomment %}
              {%- if block.settings.image == blank and block.settings.video == blank and collection.metafields.product.column_1_image == blank -%}
                {% style %}
                  .section-id-{{ section.id }} {
                    height: 1rem;
                    padding: 0;
                  }
                {% endstyle %}
              {%- elsif metafield_image != blank -%}
                {%- render 'responsive-image', image: metafield_image -%}
              {%- elsif block.settings.video == blank -%}
                {%- render 'responsive-image', image: block.settings.image -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {% render 'inline-video', video: block.settings.video, image: block.settings.image %}
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if block.settings.link != blank -%}</a>{% endif -%}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  COLUMN TITLE DISPLAY
  =============================================================================
  Displays column title if provided in block settings
  - block.settings.title: Title text from theme editor
  - text-column__title: Title styling class
  - align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}: Dynamic text alignment
  - Only renders when title is not blank
{% endcomment %}
          {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
            <h3 class="text-column__title align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  COLUMN TEXT CONTENT
  =============================================================================
  Displays text content with priority for metafields over block settings
  - Priority 1: metafield_text (collection-specific content)
  - Priority 2: block.settings.text (theme editor content)
  - text-column__text: Text content styling class
  - rte: Rich text editor styling for formatted content
  - align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}: Dynamic text alignment
  - Ensures metafield content takes precedence when available
{% endcomment %}
          {% if metafield_text != blank %}
          <div class="text-column__text rte align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}">{{ metafield_text }}</div>
          {% elsif block.settings.text != blank %}
            <div class="text-column__text rte align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
          {% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CALL-TO-ACTION BUTTON
  =============================================================================
  Displays call-to-action button when label is provided
  - button-row: Button container with proper spacing
  - inherit-colors: Inherits color scheme from section
  - align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}: Dynamic button alignment
  - data-cc-animate-click: Animation trigger for click effects
  - Dynamic button styling based on section settings:
    - link: Link-style button
    - primary: Primary button style
    - secondary: Secondary button style
  - href: Links to block.settings.link URL
{% endcomment %}
          {% if block.settings.button_label != blank %}
            <div class="button-row inherit-colors align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}">
              <a data-cc-animate-click
                 class="{% if section.settings.button_style == 'link' %}link-display {% else %}button {% if section.settings.button_style == 'secondary' %}alt{% endif %}{% endif %}"
                 href="{{ block.settings.link }}">
                {{ block.settings.button_label | escape }}
              </a>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for text columns with images section
  - name: Section name displayed in theme editor
  - class: CSS class for section-specific styling
  - settings: Global section settings for appearance and behavior
  - blocks: Block types that can be added to this section
  - presets: Default section configuration for easy addition
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Text columns with media",
  "class": "section-text-columns-with-images",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Text columns with media"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "text_alignment",
      "label": "Text alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "left",
          "label": "Left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "Center"
        },
        {
          "value": "right",
          "label": "Right"
        }
      ],
      "default": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "button_style",
      "label": "Button style",
      "default": "primary",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Button - primary",
          "value": "primary"
        },
        {
          "label": "Button - secondary",
          "value": "secondary"
        },
        {
          "label": "Link",
          "value": "link"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "media_shape",
      "label": "Media shape",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "natural",
          "label": "Natural"
        },
        {
          "value": "landscape",
          "label": "Landscape (3:2)"
        },
        {
          "value": "square",
          "label": "Square (1:1)"
        },
        {
          "value": "portrait",
          "label": "Portrait (2:3)"
        },
        {
          "value": "portrait_tall",
          "label": "Portrait (4:5)"
        },
        {
          "value": "portrait_taller",
          "label": "Portrait (9:16)"
        }
      ],
      "default": "natural"
    },
    {
      "id": "alternate_bg_color",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "label": "Use alternate section color",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "full_width",
      "label": "Wide display",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "wave",
      "label": "Wave",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "None"
        },
        {
          "value": "top",
          "label": "Top"
        },
        {
          "value": "bottom",
          "label": "Bottom"
        },
        {
          "value": "both",
          "label": "Both"
        }
      ],
      "default": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "color_bg",
      "type": "color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "font_size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Font size",
      "default": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "font_weight",
      "min": 100,
      "max": 900,
      "step": 100,
      "label": "Font weight",
      "default": 600
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text_block",
      "name": "Column",
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "enable_image",
          "type": "checkbox",
          "label": "Enable media",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Image",
          "info": "If you're using an mp4 video, it's recommended to also add an image, which will be shown while the video loads"
        },
        {
          "id": "video",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "MP4 video URL",
          "info": "E.g. https://example.com/video.mp4 - will not work with YouTube or Vimeo. [Learn more](https://cleancanvas.co.uk/support/showcase/sections/#inner-anchor-5)"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "image_width",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 700,
          "step": 10,
          "label": "Media width",
          "unit": "px",
          "default": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Heading",
          "default": "Add a title or tagline"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "default": "<p>Share blog posts, products, or promotions with your customers. Use this text to describe products, share details on availability and style, or as a space to display recent reviews or FAQs.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "button_label",
          "label": "Button label"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link",
          "label": "Link"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Text columns with media",
      "settings": {
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text_block"
        },
        {
          "type": "text_block"
        },
        {
          "type": "text_block"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
